    title: 'Amazon Bedrock Launches AI Agent Payment Capabilities With Coinbase, Stripe',
    description: 'Payments industry analysis of the significance of AI agents gaining native transactional capabilities.',
    href: '#',
    action: 'Read',
  },
  {
    outlet: 'Ledger Insights',
    type: 'Article',
    year: '2026',
